<title>CHINA: Shanghai GDP up 13.5 percent in first quarter.</title>
<headline>Shanghai GDP up 13.5 percent in first quarter.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai's gross domestic product (GDP) rose by a year-on-year 13.5 percent in the first three months of this year, the Business News said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The city's GDP in March showed a year-on-year increase of 15.5 percent, which was the highest growth rate in the period, the newspaper said.</p>
